      "sourceExcerpt": "四个互异点U_i=(x_i,y_i)共圆，当且仅当行列式det[(x_i²+y_i²,x_i,y_i,1)]_{i=1}^4=0。",
      "sourceStepIndex": 4,
      "closedSourceAssertion": "∀ (x1 y1 x2 y2 x3 y3 x4 y4 : ℝ), (x1, y1) ≠ (x2, y2) → (x1, y1) ≠ (x3, y3) → (x1, y1) ≠ (x4, y4) → (x2, y2) ≠ (x3, y3) → (x2, y2) ≠ (x4, y4) → (x3, y3) ≠ (x4, y4) → ((∃ (a b R : ℝ), R > 0 ∧ (x1 - a)^2 + (y1 - b)^2 = R^2 ∧ (x2 - a)^2 + (y2 - b)^2 = R^2 ∧ (x3 - a)^2 + (y3 - b)^2 = R^2 ∧ (x4 - a)^2 + (y4 - b)^2 = R^2) ↔ Matrix.det ![![x1^2 + y1^2, x1, y1, (1:ℝ)], ![x2^2 + y2^2, x2, y2, (1:ℝ)], ![x3^2 + y3^2, x3, y3, (1:ℝ)], ![x4^2 + y4^2, x4, y4, (1:ℝ)]] = 0)",
      "negationProofTerm": "by\n  intro h\n  have hneq : ∀ (a c : ℝ), a ≠ c → (a, (0:ℝ)) ≠ (c, (0:ℝ)) := by\n    intro a c hac hp\n    exact hac (congrArg Prod.fst hp)\n  have hdet : Matrix.det\n      ![![(0:ℝ)^2 + (0:ℝ)^2, (0:ℝ), (0:ℝ), (1:ℝ)],\n        ![((1:ℝ))^2 + (0:ℝ)^2, (1:ℝ), (0:ℝ), (1:ℝ)],\n        ![((2:ℝ))^2 + (0:ℝ)^2, (2:ℝ), (0:ℝ), (1:ℝ)],\n        ![((3:ℝ))^2 + (0:ℝ)^2, (3:ℝ), (0:ℝ), (1:ℝ)]] = 0 := by\n    apply Matrix.det_eq_zero_of_column_eq_zero (j := (2 : Fin 4))\n    intro i\n    fin_cases i <;> simp\n  have hb := h 0 0 1 0 2 0 3 0\n    (hneq (0:ℝ) (1:ℝ) (by norm_num))\n    (hneq (0:ℝ) (2:ℝ) (by norm_num))\n    (hneq (0:ℝ) (3:ℝ) (by norm_num))\n    (hneq (1:ℝ) (2:ℝ) (by norm_num))\n    (hneq (1:ℝ) (3:ℝ) (by norm_num))\n    (hneq (2:ℝ) (3:ℝ) (by norm_num))\n  have hcirc : ∃ (a b R : ℝ), R > 0 ∧\n      ((0:ℝ) - a)^2 + ((0:ℝ) - b)^2 = R^2 ∧\n      ((1:ℝ) - a)^2 + ((0:ℝ) - b)^2 = R^2 ∧\n      ((2:ℝ) - a)^2 + ((0:ℝ) - b)^2 = R^2 ∧\n      ((3:ℝ) - a)^2 + ((0:ℝ) - b)^2 = R^2 := by\n    exact hb.mpr hdet\n  rcases hcirc with ⟨a, b, R, hR, h0, h1, h2, h3⟩\n  have hahalf : a = (1:ℝ)/2 := by nlinarith [h0, h1]\n  have haone : a = (1:ℝ) := by nlinarith [h0, h2]\n  nlinarith",
      "counterexampleDescription": "取四个互异点 (0,0),(1,0),(2,0),(3,0)。行列式的第三列 y_i 全为 0，故行列式为 0；但其中任意三点已在 x 轴上共线，任何非退化圆至多与一条直线交于两点，所以这四点不共圆。这正好反驳原稿第5步把该行列式为0当作四点共圆的充要条件，因为还缺少非共线条件。",
